	(text "Power path: DUT terminals, 58 V fuse, TVS, snubber, 4-wire sense"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 22.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 4.5 4.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 40 90 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bb6c9fc9-3e4f-5c7d-a394-a99893b86f4d")
	)
	(text "DUT+ -> fuse -> DRAIN bus -> four drains. The source resistors return to PGND, which meets AGND only at NT1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 26.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "86c93aa3-0188-5ba8-8cef-9e328f104c9e")
	)
	(text "Fuse: the 58 V DC MINI part named, soldered into the direct-solder footprint (a blown\nfuse means a shorted FET, so it is replaced on the bench anyway). Ordinary blade fuses\nare rated 32 V, so 58 V is the DUT limit of this board (OVP trips at 62 V). No series\ndiode, so the load works down to 0.6 V. Reverse polarity conducts through the FET body\ndiodes and the TVS and clears the fuse. Copper: >= 5 mm of 2 oz on both layers for\nDUT+ / DRAIN / PGND. C58 and D51 directly across DRAIN / PGND at the terminals.\nJ7 / J8: plated 4.3 mm holes with a 10 mm pad, M4 bolt and ring lug; the panel binding\nposts (if fitted) are wired to the same bolts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.55 138.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5419f49b-6252-58a9-b148-adffc676bc2e")
	)
	(text "A   Terminals and DRAIN bus"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 102.33 55.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a4804307-955b-5d5a-b15e-eeb6d442db3e")
	)
	(text "J9 open: R72 / R73 connect the sense amplifier to the terminals. J9 wired to the DUT: they\ncarry only microamps and the lead drop leaves the reading. A miswired sense lead burns a\n100 R 1206 open and nothing else."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.55 226.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f61d13cb-a432-50eb-a5d0-50b5a6279624")
	)
	(text "B   4-wire sense with local fallback"
